# DESK02 probe -- open Options -> Set preferences... and dump, to measure the
# dialog's real geometry before scripting the clicks.
# Options title 160..232; "Set preferences..." is entry 6 of the Options box
# (0 SetBackground, 1 InstallIcon, 2 InstallApp, 3 InstallDevices,
#  4 RemoveIcon, 5 separator, 6 SetPrefs) -> y = 19 + 6*16 = 115..131.
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 196 8
1800 mark B_OPTIONS_OPEN
2100 move 200 123
2300 down
2303 up
2600 parkbr
3000 mark C_PREFS
